title: The_Last_Ferry_Arrival
---
Jorgen: Last ferry. Three coins, or show me a pass. #demo
Knud: Two coins and an impressive talent for bargaining. That is my offer.
<<set $Test = 2>>
<<set $TestBoolena = false>>
Knud: Surely one of those is useful.
<<jump The_Last_Ferry_Dock_Choices>>
===

title: The_Last_Ferry_Dock_Choices
---
-> Help tie the boat. (+2 coins) <<if $Test < 3>>
    <<jump The_Last_Ferry_Earn_Fare>>
-> Ask about a ferry pass. <<if not $TestBoolena>>
    <<jump The_Last_Ferry_Get_Pass>>
-> Pay three coins. <<if $Test >= 3>>
    <<jump The_Last_Ferry_Pay_Fare>>
-> Show your ferry pass. <<if $TestBoolena>>
    <<jump The_Last_Ferry_Show_Pass>>
-> Leave the dock.
    <<jump The_Last_Ferry_Walk_Away>>
<<stop>>
===

title: The_Last_Ferry_Earn_Fare
---
Knud: There. A knot so good it deserves an audience. #expression_Amused
Jorgen: It deserves two coins. Please spare me the audience. #reward #expression_Stern
<<set $Test = $Test + (2)>>
<<jump The_Last_Ferry_Dock_Choices>>
===

title: The_Last_Ferry_Get_Pass
---
Jorgen: You found my missing oar yesterday. Take this pass. #expression_Amused
<<set $TestBoolena = true>>
Knud: Finally, a reward that floats. #expression_Amused
<<jump The_Last_Ferry_Dock_Choices>>
===

title: The_Last_Ferry_Pay_Fare
---
Knud: Three coins. Try not to spend them all on pebbles.
<<set $Test = $Test - (3)>>
Jorgen: A pleasure. Mind the gap. #expression_Amused
<<jump The_Last_Ferry_Sail_Away>>
===

title: The_Last_Ferry_Show_Pass
---
Knud: One ferry pass. I knew keeping this would pay off. #expression_Amused
<<set $TestBoolena = false>>
Jorgen: Valid. Unlike your knots. #expression_Stern
<<jump The_Last_Ferry_Sail_Away>>
===

title: The_Last_Ferry_Sail_Away
---
Jorgen: All aboard. The tide waits for nobody.
Knud: Then let us stop arguing with it. #ending #sailed #expression_Amused
Knud: Next stop: somewhere dry. #ending #sailed #expression_Amused
<<stop>>
===

title: The_Last_Ferry_Walk_Away
---
Knud: I will take the scenic route.
Jorgen: It is a river. #expression_Stern
Knud: Then it will be very scenic. #ending #walked #expression_Amused
<<stop>>
===

